<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS DOWN AT $44-1/4 (FIM 201.90).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS DOWN AT $44-1/4 (FIM 201.90).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed $0-7/8 down at $44-1/4 in New York on Thursday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 201.90 markka. In Helsinki on Thursday, Nokia A closed down 8.00 markka at 201.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed $0-1/4 lower at $32-1/2 on Wall Street. The price equals about 74.14 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 0.30 markka at 74.30.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed down $0-5/8 at $19-3/4 on in New York on Thursday. The price corresponds to 90.11 markka.</p>
<p>Rauma closed down 0.80 markka at 92.00 markka in Helsinki.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
